// The class 'PageDefault' contains a set of default widgets - as they appear as \
// soon as you take widgets from the Gallery.
// 
// The class 'PageFlat' presents the widget design 'Flat'. The unit 'FlatWidgets' \
// contains the necessary resources and configurations for this widget style.
// 
// The class 'PageSteel' presents the widget design 'Steel'. The unit 'SteelWidgets' \
// contains the necessary resources and configurations for this widget style.
// 
// The class 'PageOrange' presents the widget design 'Orange'. The unit 'OrangeWidgets' \
// contains the necessary resources and configurations for this widget style.
// 
// This class 'Application' shows the widget pages and let the user navigate between \
// them.
note legend Note1
{
  attr Bounds = <450,20,1050,280>;
}

